    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mystery puzzle game that you want to play through in one evening!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/472b05d8853655ce7df7c65dee8c9c13.avif?t=1749077162\" width=486 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/f0855a91ca7c3a70717190ecb2dbde2d.poster.avif?t=1749077162\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/f0855a91ca7c3a70717190ecb2dbde2d.webm?t=1749077162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/f0855a91ca7c3a70717190ecb2dbde2d.mp4?t=1749077162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the eerie elegance of Hotel Luximinal, where every corridor tells a story and every corner hides a secret. This is no ordinary hotel. Strange occurrences, shifting objects, and unexplainable anomalies await your discovery. Will you solve the mystery of the disturbances, or be consumed by the hotel forever?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>7 Levels with Mysterious Charm</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hotel Hallway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private Poolroom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hotel Gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waiting Rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midnight Dining Hall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vintage 1925 Office</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Suite</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/5d10853c91b599235fd4ad7b45c14b37.avif?t=1749077162\" width=486 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/6cf1779c51676f2128fd517967cf3fae.poster.avif?t=1749077162\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/6cf1779c51676f2128fd517967cf3fae.webm?t=1749077162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/6cf1779c51676f2128fd517967cf3fae.mp4?t=1749077162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the Hidden:</strong> Spot anomalies \u2013 subtle, surreal changes that challenge your perception. From vanishing vases to disturbing distortions in decor, every detail counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Unique Levels:</strong> Immerse yourself in 7 atmospheric environments, from opulent Art Deco lobbies to surreal pool chambers. Each level tells its own story with distinct challenges and secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find all 210 Anomalies!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 anomalies in each of the 7 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are easy to spot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others are trickier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to memorize everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels get harder as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, or you might get trapped forever!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/53a5d4adfe010058ccd580b4494f6236.avif?t=1749077162\" width=486 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/d0896bb55b902ad8efd4f6375a9e938b.poster.avif?t=1749077162\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/d0896bb55b902ad8efd4f6375a9e938b.webm?t=1749077162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/d0896bb55b902ad8efd4f6375a9e938b.mp4?t=1749077162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each correct choice brings you one floor higher. Get it right 7 times and return to the lobby.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Rules Are Simple:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start at floor 0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon entering: Study every detail in the room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think there\u2019s no anomaly? Enter the \u201cother\u201d elevator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think there\u2019s an anomaly? Return to the starting elevator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correct guess: Go up one floor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrong guess: Return to floor 0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess correctly 8 times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the next level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the hotel as a successful researcher for your company</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/cd12c2cf08aa453cb9fff287a194caae.avif?t=1749077162\" width=486 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/31f7a336aa3e8e24e6710632be0e6d22.avif?t=1749077162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Hotel Luximinal Is Unique:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Art Deco Design:</strong> A surreal blend of elegance and unease, inspired by the glamor of the 1920s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Atmosphere:</strong> Dynamic soundscapes, eerie visuals, and the constant feeling you\u2019re not alone.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find the Answer to the 3 Big Questions</strong><br><i>Post your theory in the community. What do you believe happened?</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s wrong with this hotel?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s the story behind those strange elevators?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the true effect of Luximinal?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/f168223192f60814c5c97f5da4fdef54.avif?t=1749077162\" width=486 height=71 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging single-player experience focused on detail and perception</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic anomalies create a fresh experience with each playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud support for synchronized progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to reward your exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268510/extras/f31f12f87a5e48d18a7e2b6efd1df081.avif?t=1749077162\" width=486 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus:</strong> The lobby features a jukebox with over 20 tracks. Enjoy the music, click through the songs, and let the atmosphere envelop you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jazz</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing background music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This hotel is alive \u2013 and it\u2019s watching you. Will you rise to the challenge, or will the anomalies claim you?</p>",
